---
description: Deploy immediately when user requests deployment
alwaysApply: true
---

# Deployment Requests

When the user requests deployment (for example "deploy", "deploy dev", or "push this to dev"), execute the deployment steps immediately without asking for additional confirmation.

After deployment:
1. Report whether deployment succeeded or failed.
2. Include the target environment and stack.
3. Include the key error if deployment fails and the next fix attempt.

Do not ask "should I deploy?" after a direct deployment request.
